        <a class="wlx-path cyan p1" href="/recomp/what" data-wlx-drag>
            <span class="number">01</span>
            <strong>WHAT IS RECOMP?</strong>
            <small>Understand the system</small>
        </a>
        <a class="wlx-path green p2" href="/recomp/how" data-wlx-drag>
            <span class="number">02</span>
            <strong>HOW IT WORKS</strong>
            <small>See the four signals</small>
        </a>
        <a class="wlx-path gold p3" href="/recomp/evidence" data-wlx-drag>
            <span class="number">03</span>
            <strong>THE EVIDENCE</strong>
            <small>Science over hype</small>
        </a>
        <a class="wlx-path purple p4" href="/recomp/start" data-wlx-drag>
            <span class="number">04</span>
            <strong>BUILD YOUR PLAN</strong>
            <small>Create your free account</small>
